 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "From the tribe of Benjamin, Palti son of Rafu",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.29,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sent by Moses from the Wilderness of Paran",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "One leader chosen from each ancestral line",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.13,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To scout the land of Canaan, divine",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "See what the land is like, strong or weak",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are their towns open camps or fortified peaks",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Is the soil rich or poor, trees on it or not",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 2.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Be bold and bring back the fruit, the lot",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They went up from Zin as far as Rehob",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Neared Lebo-hamath, tested the path",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days they traveled through the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then returned to the people, in the hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "See what the land is like, strong or weak",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are their towns open camps or fortified peaks",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Is the soil rich or poor, trees on it or not",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 2.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Be bold and bring back the fruit, the lot",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It truly does flow with milk and honey",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 5.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the people are strong, cities are large",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We saw the descendants of Anak there",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Amalekites in the Negev, the air",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hittites and Jebusites in the hills",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Canaanites by the sea and the fields",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Caleb quieted the people before Moses",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Said we should go up and take possession",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the others said we cannot attack",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are stronger than we are, weak and lack",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
